# Paycor: Payroll & HR Software

> Paycor is a human capital management (HCM) software provider offering payroll, HR, talent management, benefits administration, recruiting, and workforce management solutions for small, midsize, and enterprise organizations.

## About Paycor

Paycor provides an integrated HCM platform that connects payroll, HR, benefits, talent acquisition, talent development, and workforce management into a single system. The platform is designed to help organizations manage compliance, improve operational efficiency, and support employee development across multiple industries and company sizes.

## Core Platform & Solutions

- [Payroll Software](https://www.paycor.com/hcm-software/payroll-software/ ) – Comprehensive payroll processing software that automates tax calculations and filings, manages compliance with federal and state regulations, and provides reporting tools to improve payroll accuracy and visibility.

- [HR Software](https://www.paycor.com/hcm-software/hr-software/ ) – Centralized human resources management system for employee records, compliance documentation, policy management, and HR workflows that support day-to-day workforce administration.

- [Talent Development](https://www.paycor.com/hcm-software/talent-development/ ) – Tools for performance management, goal tracking, employee engagement, career pathing, and learning initiatives designed to align workforce development with business objectives.

- [Onboarding Software](https://www.paycor.com/hcm-software/onboarding-software/ ) – Digital onboarding workflows that streamline new hire documentation, task management, compliance forms, and early employee engagement processes.

- [Scheduling Software](https://www.paycor.com/hcm-software/scheduling-software/ ) – Workforce scheduling tools that help organizations manage shift planning, labor coverage, compliance with wage laws, and employee availability.

- [Time & Attendance Software](https://www.paycor.com/hcm-software/time-attendance-software/ ) – Time tracking and attendance management software that captures hours worked, monitors overtime, and provides real-time labor cost insights.

- [Recruiting Software](https://www.paycor.com/hcm-software/recruiting-software/ ) – Applicant tracking system (ATS) designed to support job posting distribution, candidate management, interview coordination, and hiring workflows.

- [Benefits Administration Software](https://www.paycor.com/hcm-software/benefits-software/ ) – Benefits enrollment and administration tools that manage open enrollment, eligibility tracking, and employee benefits communication.

